    cat: "conflitti",
    title: "Blast heard in Yemen’s Aden as Houthis claim attack on military camp",
    summary: "Smoke seen rising near airport in Aden as Houthis say they attacked a military camp with a ballistic missile.",
    preview: "BREAKINGBREAKING, Smoke seen rising near airport in Aden as Houthis say they attacked a military camp with a ballistic missile. |Updated: 40 minutes ago A powerful explosion has been heard in the city of Aden in southern Yemen, an Al Jazeera journalist and police official said. A police official said on Wednesday that smoke was rising near the airport in Aden, which is controlled by the internationally recognised Yemeni government. Reporting from Yemen’s Taiz, Al Jazeera’s Maha Ali said “the Houthi group targeted Aden airport with a ballistic missile”.",
    body: "BREAKINGBREAKING,\n\nSmoke seen rising near airport in Aden as Houthis say they attacked a military camp with a ballistic missile.\n\n|Updated: 40 minutes ago\n\nA powerful explosion has been heard in the city of Aden in southern Yemen, an Al Jazeera journalist and police official said.\n\nA police official said on Wednesday that smoke was rising near the airport in Aden, which is controlled by the internationally recognised Yemeni government.\n\nReporting from Yemen’s Taiz, Al Jazeera’s Maha Ali said “the Houthi group targeted Aden airport with a ballistic missile”.\n\nHouthi spokesman Yahya Saree said the group targeted the Saudi-led coalition’s “military operation room at the Badr Camp in Aden with a ballistic missile”.\n\nHe said that “the strike was precise and direct”.\n\nMore to come…",
